[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9540.429, "timestamp": "02:39:00", "text": "需要稍微打开一下通风机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9543.469, "timestamp": "02:39:03", "text": "快的。所以，你知道，呃，关于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9547.75, "timestamp": "02:39:07", "text": "周末，有一辆车"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9550.389, "timestamp": "02:39:10", "text": "经过我家就像我的房子一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9554.71, "timestamp": "02:39:14", "text": "靠近路边。所以，一辆车经过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9558.07, "timestamp": "02:39:18", "text": "其中包含大量毒素。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9560.389, "timestamp": "02:39:20", "text": "那是为了让蚊子死掉的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9564.429, "timestamp": "02:39:24", "text": "一切。这是一大团浓雾。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9567.469, "timestamp": "02:39:27", "text": "就是那玩意儿，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9570.71, "timestamp": "02:39:30", "text": "嗯，我应该打开通风口。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9574.03, "timestamp": "02:39:34", "text": "东西。我……我喘不过气来。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9577.71, "timestamp": "02:39:37", "text": "疼痛。我的窗户也关着。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9586.87, "timestamp": "02:39:46", "text": "向上。你知道，总有一天当这种情况发生时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9589.67, "timestamp": "02:39:49", "text": "事情发生了，我的通风口……呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9593.03, "timestamp": "02:39:53", "text": "通风装置，呃，风扇在转"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9595.67, "timestamp": "02:39:55", "text": "里面。所以我把外面的东西都放进了我的身体里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9599.91, "timestamp": "02:39:59", "text": "房间，显然那天呃这个"}]